Package: CCIGSVA
Title: Pathway Enrichment of Cell-Cell Communication Profiles
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Kyeonghun", "Jeong", email = "scientist0205@snu.ac.kr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds ligand-receptor interaction by sample matrices for each
    source-target cell-type pair and calculates pathway enrichment with gene set
    variation analysis. Provides explicit sample handling, cell-type coverage
    filtering and structured results. Implements the approach described by
    Jeong et al. (2023) <doi:10.1038/s41598-023-46350-2>.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports: GSVA (>= 1.50.0), SummarizedExperiment, S4Vectors, BiocParallel
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/Khreat0205/CCIGSVA
BugReports: https://github.com/Khreat0205/CCIGSVA/issues
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
